    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take up arms and take care of robot buddies in this co-op action roguelite. Hunt giant hostile robots that have stolen the sun to harvest their mechanical parts, upgrade the machinery you can build and strengthen the bond between you and your Nova robot buddies!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SYNC UP WITH NOVAS</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >20 different and unique robots called Novas await your assistance to take on any challenges that stand in your way. Figure out your preferred way to upgrade them and their unique elemental composition, so that they in turn can help you grow stronger too. By combining your power, you both get closer to becoming unstoppable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2967610/extras/03962130c39ab470537109ae0e609023.poster.avif?t=1749727353\" width=800 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2967610/extras/03962130c39ab470537109ae0e609023.webm?t=1749727353\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2967610/extras/03962130c39ab470537109ae0e609023.mp4?t=1749727353\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FIGHT GIANT BOSSES</strong> Enormous bosses plan to stand in your way. They have tons of different ways to take you down, and even more ways to upgrade themselves and get more creative with how to send you back to where you came from. And these bosses don't just plan to stand by idly while you take their buddies out. Screw up the planning of your route, and they might even invade your fights to send you packing even earlier!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2967610/extras/e2c49ed357d65550656a2de3bf3d78cf.poster.avif?t=1749727353\" width=668 height=334 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2967610/extras/e2c49ed357d65550656a2de3bf3d78cf.webm?t=1749727353\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2967610/extras/e2c49ed357d65550656a2de3bf3d78cf.mp4?t=1749727353\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BUILD AN ARSENAL</strong> Get new blueprints and the materials to help your Novas build better machinery and constructs to take on these giant bosses. They're builders, not battlers, and it's up to you to utilize their ingenious gadgets to get the upper hand.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2967610/extras/2debc7b57c08d33cc2102c1a258615ec.poster.avif?t=1749727353\" width=800 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2967610/extras/2debc7b57c08d33cc2102c1a258615ec.webm?t=1749727353\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2967610/extras/2debc7b57c08d33cc2102c1a258615ec.mp4?t=1749727353\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>PLAY SOLO OR WITH FRIENDS</strong> Take down all of the bosses solo or join up with up to four friends in online co-op. Pick your favorite among the warriors of the Dawn Initiative, and ride out together with an equally large group of Novas!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2967610/extras/34b18a634c8e2b7f1625337012d1d7a7.poster.avif?t=1749727353\" width=800 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2967610/extras/34b18a634c8e2b7f1625337012d1d7a7.webm?t=1749727353\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2967610/extras/34b18a634c8e2b7f1625337012d1d7a7.mp4?t=1749727353\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take up arms and take care of robot buddies in this co-op action roguelite. Hunt giant hostile robots that have stolen the sun to harvest their mechanical parts, upgrade the machinery you can build and strengthen the bond between you and your Nova robot buddies!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SYNC UP WITH NOVAS</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >20 different and unique robots called Novas await your assistance to take on any challenges that stand in your way. Figure out your preferred way to upgrade them and their unique elemental composition, so that they in turn can help you grow stronger too. By combining your power, you both get closer to becoming unstoppable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2967610/extras/03962130c39ab470537109ae0e609023.poster.avif?t=1749727353\" width=800 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2967610/extras/03962130c39ab470537109ae0e609023.webm?t=1749727353\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2967610/extras/03962130c39ab470537109ae0e609023.mp4?t=1749727353\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FIGHT GIANT BOSSES</strong> Enormous bosses plan to stand in your way. They have tons of different ways to take you down, and even more ways to upgrade themselves and get more creative with how to send you back to where you came from. And these bosses don't just plan to stand by idly while you take their buddies out. Screw up the planning of your route, and they might even invade your fights to send you packing even earlier!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2967610/extras/e2c49ed357d65550656a2de3bf3d78cf.poster.avif?t=1749727353\" width=668 height=334 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2967610/extras/e2c49ed357d65550656a2de3bf3d78cf.webm?t=1749727353\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2967610/extras/e2c49ed357d65550656a2de3bf3d78cf.mp4?t=1749727353\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BUILD AN ARSENAL</strong> Get new blueprints and the materials to help your Novas build better machinery and constructs to take on these giant bosses. They're builders, not battlers, and it's up to you to utilize their ingenious gadgets to get the upper hand.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2967610/extras/2debc7b57c08d33cc2102c1a258615ec.poster.avif?t=1749727353\" width=800 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2967610/extras/2debc7b57c08d33cc2102c1a258615ec.webm?t=1749727353\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2967610/extras/2debc7b57c08d33cc2102c1a258615ec.mp4?t=1749727353\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>PLAY SOLO OR WITH FRIENDS</strong> Take down all of the bosses solo or join up with up to four friends in online co-op. Pick your favorite among the warriors of the Dawn Initiative, and ride out together with an equally large group of Novas!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2967610/extras/34b18a634c8e2b7f1625337012d1d7a7.poster.avif?t=1749727353\" width=800 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2967610/extras/34b18a634c8e2b7f1625337012d1d7a7.webm?t=1749727353\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2967610/extras/34b18a634c8e2b7f1625337012d1d7a7.mp4?t=1749727353\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
